            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lino nyika yoonse iyoosandulwa kuba ibanda, kuzwa ku-Geba akusikila ku-Rimoni kumusanza waku-Jerusalemu. Pele Jerusalemu ucinoosyeede ajulu mpobede, kuzwa kumulyango wa-Benjamini kusikila kumulyango mutaanzi, nkukuti mulyango wakucooko, akuzwa kucisanza caHananeli akusikila kudindi lyakusinina waini lyamwami. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:11"
          },
          "items": [
