          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nkabela nceeci cuumo Jehova ncati umye bantu boonse beza kukulwisya Jerusalemu. Uyoobozeka nyama yabo nibaciimvwi amaulu aabo, aalo meso aabo ayoobola mumakomba aao, azyalo indimi zyabo ziyoobola mukanwa lyabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.14.15"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Sam 14:15",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mubuzuba obo bayoosikilwa lupyopyongano lupati luzwa kuliJehova, aboobo umwi aumwi uyoojata ijanza lyamweenzinyina. Boonse bayootambika maanza aabo cakuumana, umwi aumwi mweenzinyina. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Acalo cisi ca-Juda ciyoolwisya Jerusalemu. Nkabela lubono lwabamasi oonse aaengelede luyooyobololwa, ingolida ansiliva azyakusama zinji loko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 14:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Alimwi luumo luli mbubonya luyoowida ambizi amabbiza ankamela ambongolo abanyama boonse bali muzilao.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.14.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.14.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
