        },
        {
          "text": "Lino bantu boonse basyeede akati kamisyobo eyo iyakasika kuzoolwisya Jerusalemu bayooboola myaka yoonse kuzookomba Mwami Jehova wamakamu akuzoolya ipobwe lyazilao. ",
